 Cost-Optimization Settings for Azure Container AppsWhen you provision this via the Azure CLI or portal, apply these exact configuration properties to ensure it remains budget-friendly:Scale to Zero: Set minReplicas to 0 and maxReplicas to 2. If nobody hits your portfolio gateway URL for a few minutes, Azure automatically spins the container down to nothing, stopping the billing clock.Minimal Allocation: Assign the lowest compute allocation profile available: 0.25 vCPU and 0.5 GiB Memory. The FastAPI AI firewall middleware is lightweight and does not need expensive compute cores.Ingress: Enable external ingress on port 8080 to accept public HTTP traffic.
